{"id":"aqad1qh7bva2z3whgk6d9kzog","title":"预测市场与民调在2026中期选举中的共识与误判","originalTitle":"Prediction markets and polls mostly agreed in the 2026 midterms, and both missed some races","summary":"2026中期选举中，预测市场与民调在多数选区达成共识，但均错判部分选区（如爱荷华州参议院选举）。分析指出，预测市场因覆盖范围差异（如Mississippi州无合约）和过度自信导致误差，民调则更准确描述不确定性。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Crypto Briefing"},"links":{"original":"https://cryptobriefing.com/prediction-markets-polls-2026-midterms-accuracy/"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-16T19:17:48.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-16T19:22:25.599Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-16T19:22:25.599Z","category":"crypto-market","tags":["研究报告","监管处罚"],"score":72,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":"Estefano Gomez","body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"regulation","name":"监管与政策"},{"slug":"research","name":"研究报告"},{"slug":"opinions","name":"观点"},{"slug":"howto","name":"教程与避坑"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}